anding barriers; custom-made adjustable louvre shutters; aircraft refueling vehicles and systems; braai stands and fireplaces; overhead cranes, hoists and lifting equipment; fuel storage tanks; speed control retarder systems; underground scrapers and wear parts, grizzly frames and segments, and other allied mining equipment; metal gates, metal fencing and railings, timber gates, and metal decking fence panels; and handcrafted wooden gates and garden products; materials handling equipment; roll-over protection bars; and modular buildings, office, mess units, and toilet and shower blocks. It is also involved in manufacturing of ladders, fibreglass ladders, trolleys, as well as distributing castors and accessories; supplying of commercial grades of stainless steel and aluminum in sheets, plates, coils, flats, angles, tubes, and pipes; supplying of ready-mix concrete and mortars, pumping of concrete, and crushed stone products; manufacturing and trading of industrial doors; supplying of raw materials for use in construction and infrastructure industries; and operation of steel service center. The company was incorporated in 1993 and is based in Umhlanga, South Africa.","employees":null,"website":"https://argent.co.za","country":"South Africa","city":"Umhlanga","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Treve Robert Hendry B.Com, B.Compt(Hons), C.A., CA (SA)","title":"CEO & Executive Director"},{"name":"Mr. Hansie Marthinus Meyer C.A.","title":"Financial Director & Executive Director"},{"name":"Mr. Jaco  Dauth","title":"Company Secretary"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":7.219,"tpe":7.894,"ps":1.479,"pfcf":10.34,"peg":0.84,"pb":1.358,"ev_ebitda":4.437,"rev_growth":0.241,"eps_growth":0.907,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2295,"eps_growth_next":0.108,"div_yield":0.0253,"roe":0.1011,"roa":0.05131,"de":19.53,"gross_margin":0.3585,"op_margin":0.1759,"profit_margin":0.07225,"current_ratio":1.885},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":null,"sector":7.219,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":